  <dc:creator>ModelingEvolution</dc:creator>
  <dc:description>Strongly-typed file system path handling with AbsolutePath and RelativePath value types. Features intuitive path arithmetic operators (Relative + Relative, Absolute + Relative, Absolute - Absolute), cross-platform normalization, IParsable support, and JSON serialization.</dc:description>
